    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Major Physical Mutation</strong></p><p>Your skin becomes covered with thousands o growths that make bizarre patterns on your skin. Consult the table below to determine which kind. These growths provide no utility, but look very disturbing. You get a -20 Fellowship modifier. You can only gain this mutation once.</p><table><tbody><tr><td><p>1d10</p></td><td><p>Result</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Eyes</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Ears</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Fingers</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>Mouths</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>Nostrils</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>Nipples</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7</p></td><td><p>Teeth</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>Toes</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9</p></td><td><p>Tongues</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10</p></td><td><p>Warts</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p>"
    },
